*.bak

# Run logs from the aiflow commands. The rule arrived after .aiflow/onboard.log
# had already been committed, and an ignore rule does nothing for a file that is
# already tracked - which is how 35 *.bak files survived the line above
# (enigma2_player-noq).
*.log
